+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 A throwing async request handler reaches the error handler (test/Route.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 A throwing async error handler reaches the next error handler (test/Route.js) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Catch an async handler's rejection in handle_request and handle_error (lib/router/layer.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 A helper that tells whether async functions parse (test/support/utils.js)
